OL,3,GNEWSACity plans to spend #2.17m on SEND
OL,4,Aoverhaul
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city could be short of 475 places for
OL,7,Fchildren with special educational needs
OL,8,Fand disabilities (SEND) by 2030 unless
OL,9,Faction is taken, according to a report.
OL,11,FPeterborough City Council is planning a
OL,12,F#2.17m overhaul of its SEND support
OL,13,Fsystem, including deploying educational
OL,14,Fpsychologists and therapists in local
OL,15,Fcommunities.
OL,17,FIt says "intensive" work is under way
OL,18,Fto overhaul the support it provides to
OL,19,Fchildren with SEND.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
